I need the light.

648
00:50:57.320 --> 00:50:59.209
Thank you, son. Okay.

649
00:50:59.400 --> 00:51:01.721
Hey, good job.
You're doing great.

650
00:51:01.800 --> 00:51:03.404
All right. Let me get
the chair, here.

651
00:51:03.480 --> 00:51:05.482
Okay, we are almost done.

652
00:51:06.880 --> 00:51:08.689
I'm gonna pick him up on the
