658
00:51:23.520 --> 00:51:24.760
Whoa!
Hey, hey, hey!

659
00:51:24.840 --> 00:51:26.922
I've got him, I've got him.
I got him.

660
00:51:27.320 --> 00:51:29.288
Okay. Okay, all right!

661
