Are you okay?

713
00:54:41.840 --> 00:54:43.126
Oh, God.

714
00:54:46.600 --> 00:54:51.128
I am so sorry
about Henry, okay?

715
00:54:51.320 --> 00:54:52.845
I'm so sorry.

716
00:54:52.920 --> 00:54:54.920
